<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 11-2 IN 2ND INNINGS AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 11-2 IN 2ND INNINGS AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, 157 runs behind</p>
<p>South Africa on first innings, were 11 for two in their second</p>
<p>innings at tea on the third day of the third and final test at</p>
<p>Centurion Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 227 and 11-2; South Africa 384.</p>
</text>
